  DJ Karen Funshine \\| Facilitator TBA\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout the DJ\nKa
 ren Funshine (Karen Smith) has been dancing since age 3\, with movement as
  her lifelong ally. A veteran raver & EDM enthusiast\, she was delighted t
 o discover 5Rhythms and ecstatic dance 10 years ago in Austin - a sober an
 d judgment-free space to get wild & free. She’s since facilitated many w
 omen’s conscious dance circles and a vibrant live-instrument dance - wea
 ving music and somatic movement to alchemize emotion\, open the heart\, an
 d awaken joy. Recently relocated to Asheville\, Karen is honored to share 
 her passion and playfulness with her beautiful new community through the u
 niversal language of music and dance.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note t
 hat the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circl
 e and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure 
