  beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRC
 LE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollec
 tive.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fb
 clid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjA
